  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AssessmentIntroPanel
  modeId: COC3
  panel: {fileID: 800054441}
  titleText: {fileID: 800054440}
  objectivesText: {fileID: 800054439}
  rulesText: {fileID: 800054438}
  startButton: {fileID: 800054437}
  title: "COC 3 \u2014 Set-up Computer Servers"
  objectives:
  - Set the server's network configuration to the values in the job order.
  - Create the user accounts and groups the job order specifies.
  - Set up the shared folders and apply the correct NTFS permissions to each.
  - "Grant exactly the access level asked for \u2014 Modify and Full control are
    not interchangeable."
  - Verify each setting before moving on. Work through all 35 steps in order.
  rules: "Score and mistakes come from the same counter shown on your HUD, and the
    report breaks them down step by step. During a graded run, a dialog the system
    rejects \u2014 a wrong IP, the wrong container, the wrong permission level \u2014
    counts as a mistake. In practice those are free; here they are not. Hints and
    tutorial prompts are switched off."
  bullet: "\u2022  "
  beginOnStart:
  - {fileID: 693536070}
  hideUntilStart:
