  m_text: 'LO1.3 - Prove the restrictions actually hold.


    Start > Event Viewer.
    Under Windows Logs select Security, then Filter Current Log.


    Filter for
    Audit Failure. A refused attempt from an account outside STUDENTS is evidence
    the permissions are working; the successes are thousands of entries and no finding.'
