  m_text: 'LO1.3 - Confirm no unintended account inherited access to the share.


    Same
    window, Permissions tab. Read where each entry came from.


    An entry inherited
    from the parent folder cannot be removed from here while inheritance is on -
    it comes straight back. Disable inheritance so this folder''s permissions are
    its own.'
