  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "LO2.2 \u2014 A server must never lease its own address from DHCP. Every
    client and every service on this network will look for it at a fixed address.\n\nOpen
    Network Connections, then Ethernet \u25B8 Properties \u25B8 Internet Protocol
    Version 4 (TCP/IPv4) \u25B8 Properties.\n\nSet the static address, subnet mask
    and default gateway from the job order, and set the Preferred DNS server to this
    machine's own loopback address \u2014 it will be hosting the DNS role itself.\n\nApply
    them together with OK. Windows commits the whole sheet at once."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
