  m_text: 'LO3.1 - TEST 2. Verify the shared printer from CLIENT01.


    Start >
    Devices and Printers. Select the printer shared from the server - not the local
    PDF printer - open Printer properties, and print a test page from the General
    tab.


    The page proves the whole chain at once: shared, found by name, driver
    installed, account permitted.'
