  m_text: 'Configure the DHCP scope that will serve the lab clients.


    In the
    New Scope Wizard, enter the starting address of the pool, the subnet mask, and
    the router address handed out with each lease.


    Note the pool starts well
    clear of 192.168.10.10 - a scope must never overlap a static address.'
