      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Preferred DNS server points at 127.0.0.1 \u2014 the server's own loopback.\n\nThat
    looks circular and isn't. This machine is about to become the DNS server for
    the whole domain, so the name it needs to resolve first is its own. Point it
    at a router or a public resolver instead and domain join will fail on the client
    with an error that names neither DNS nor the cause.\n\nTap NEXT to continue."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
